    "type": "game",
    "name": "Land of Chaos Online II: Revolution",
    "steam_appid": 981870,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Return of LOCO \u2013 Land of Chaos Online II Revolution</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The Ultimate Action MOBA\u2011RPG, Crafted by Fans, for Nostalgia!</i> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The LOCO universe, which has been closed in the darkest world for a long time, is now awakening!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/981870/extras/796264a102ed99c5ecf32a35b7a94546.poster.avif?t=1745864395\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/981870/extras/796264a102ed99c5ecf32a35b7a94546.webm?t=1745864395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/981870/extras/796264a102ed99c5ecf32a35b7a94546.mp4?t=1745864395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Land of Chaos Online II Revolution \u2013 a solo passion project brought to life with Unreal Engine 4. Featuring striking stylized visuals and razor-sharp performance, LOCOII redefines what an action-packed MOBA can be. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/981870/extras/4bc7f4fd13a6126dc1d18b5a121b1eb9.poster.avif?t=1745864395\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/981870/extras/4bc7f4fd13a6126dc1d18b5a121b1eb9.webm?t=1745864395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/981870/extras/4bc7f4fd13a6126dc1d18b5a121b1eb9.mp4?t=1745864395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Developed by Danal now thriving on the passion of our global fan community, LOCOII blends the strategic depth of RTS with the adrenaline, and just a touch of RPG flair. Over 20 distinct champions await your command, towering brutes who soak up damage, sinister spellcasters who reshape the battlefield, colossal beasts that shake the earth, and agile gunslingers who strike from afar, each boasting their own signature abilities and personalities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seamlessly swap between three heroes in the heat of combat to chain their skills into devastating combos. As you fight, your champions earn experience, unlock new abilities, and equip powerful artifacts to sharpen their edge. Storm fortified camps, topple gargantuan bosses, or lead your guild into epic 10v10 clashes, the key to victory is thinking fast, choosing the right lineup, and outmaneuvering your foes at every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Note: This isn\u2019t your average MOBA. This is Land of Chaos Online Action MOBA-RPG!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/981870/extras/477d0a11ed15955b64b898202b806a4b.avif?t=1745864395\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick three heroes from the Forces of Nature or the Army of Purgatorium, then switch them on-the-fly to unleash each warrior\u2019s set of 10 unique abilities. Perfect your timing to chain skills into devastating combos and overwhelm your foes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/981870/extras/10e4f196e338b0245aa1dbdf117f9e40.poster.avif?t=1745864395\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/981870/extras/10e4f196e338b0245aa1dbdf117f9e40.webm?t=1745864395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/981870/extras/10e4f196e338b0245aa1dbdf117f9e40.mp4?t=1745864395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/981870/extras/ff9d88aace74c0df20530bbf5639ea8f.avif?t=1745864395\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/981870/extras/30ccfa4d4ce697419e7e560689728a46.poster.avif?t=1745864395\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/981870/extras/30ccfa4d4ce697419e7e560689728a46.webm?t=1745864395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/981870/extras/30ccfa4d4ce697419e7e560689728a46.mp4?t=1745864395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/981870/extras/a1b853b0553b0b1358b7344ce0d49c6e.avif?t=1745864395\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Venture into sprawling battlegrounds to capture strategic points across diverse maps, game modes, and difficulty tiers. Team up for heart-pounding 10v10 clashes, intense PvP duels, or massive guild wars, every match is a fresh test of strategy and reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/981870/extras/0b38db62ca026cb8de4b4365e54afe18.avif?t=1745864395\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready for <strong>THE MOBA ACTION?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/981870/extras/ca7e9f4ba098c2680b88326b459e5c43.poster.avif?t=1745864395\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/981870/extras/ca7e9f4ba098c2680b88326b459e5c43.webm?t=1745864395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/981870/extras/ca7e9f4ba098c2680b88326b459e5c43.mp4?t=1745864395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move with your team as one in massive battlegrounds up to 10v10 and overcome your opponent. Think strategically, use your eyes and reflexes at the speed of light, push your limits. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick 5 of 10 unique abilities, dominate your opponent, destroy all enemy towers, kill all the guardians, take over their base and win the game. This is only the first step of your ascension, do not underestimate the thrill. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick the most unusual items and customize your own build. Explore the limits of the game, combine your build with numerous of characters and skills. With your own style, rule the battlefield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather your friends, start your own faction, get the opportunity to meet with millions of players, strengthen your bonds, overcome your weaknesses together and fight side to side against your enemies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Be a part of the community</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/981870/extras/4460044e4033a5fcc4e8e6cd50f0a9c4.avif?t=1745864395\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be a part of the discussion, whether it be showing off cool screenshots &amp; videos, or helping to discuss balancing and new content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MADE FOR FANS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/981870/extras/fe8a25de665df0597aacb981042f8c7e.avif?t=1745864395\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This entire game is brought to life by a single developer, fueled by fan passion. Dive in and join the revolution today!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Return of LOCO \u2013 Land of Chaos Online II Revolution</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The Ultimate Action MOBA\u2011RPG, Crafted by Fans, for Nostalgia!</i> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The LOCO universe, which has been closed in the darkest world for a long time, is now awakening!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/981870/extras/796264a102ed99c5ecf32a35b7a94546.poster.avif?t=1745864395\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/981870/extras/796264a102ed99c5ecf32a35b7a94546.webm?t=1745864395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/981870/extras/796264a102ed99c5ecf32a35b7a94546.mp4?t=1745864395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Land of Chaos Online II Revolution \u2013 a solo passion project brought to life with Unreal Engine 4. Featuring striking stylized visuals and razor-sharp performance, LOCOII redefines what an action-packed MOBA can be. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/981870/extras/4bc7f4fd13a6126dc1d18b5a121b1eb9.poster.avif?t=1745864395\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/981870/extras/4bc7f4fd13a6126dc1d18b5a121b1eb9.webm?t=1745864395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/981870/extras/4bc7f4fd13a6126dc1d18b5a121b1eb9.mp4?t=1745864395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Developed by Danal now thriving on the passion of our global fan community, LOCOII blends the strategic depth of RTS with the adrenaline, and just a touch of RPG flair. Over 20 distinct champions await your command, towering brutes who soak up damage, sinister spellcasters who reshape the battlefield, colossal beasts that shake the earth, and agile gunslingers who strike from afar, each boasting their own signature abilities and personalities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seamlessly swap between three heroes in the heat of combat to chain their skills into devastating combos. As you fight, your champions earn experience, unlock new abilities, and equip powerful artifacts to sharpen their edge. Storm fortified camps, topple gargantuan bosses, or lead your guild into epic 10v10 clashes, the key to victory is thinking fast, choosing the right lineup, and outmaneuvering your foes at every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Note: This isn\u2019t your average MOBA. This is Land of Chaos Online Action MOBA-RPG!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/981870/extras/477d0a11ed15955b64b898202b806a4b.avif?t=1745864395\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick three heroes from the Forces of Nature or the Army of Purgatorium, then switch them on-the-fly to unleash each warrior\u2019s set of 10 unique abilities. Perfect your timing to chain skills into devastating combos and overwhelm your foes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/981870/extras/10e4f196e338b0245aa1dbdf117f9e40.poster.avif?t=1745864395\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/981870/extras/10e4f196e338b0245aa1dbdf117f9e40.webm?t=1745864395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/981870/extras/10e4f196e338b0245aa1db